      "author": "ZakAyesh",
      "number": 1370,
      "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\n<!-- Briefly describe the changes in this PR -->\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## For Task PRs\r\n\r\n<!-- Delete this section if your PR doesn't add/modify tasks in src/tasks/ -->\r\n\r\n**Task path**: `src/tasks/<network>/<task-name>`\r\n\r\n**Tenderly simulation link**: <!-- paste your Tenderly link here -->\r\n\r\n### Simulation Checklist\r\n\r\n> These boxes must be checked before your PR can be merged.\r\n\r\n- [ ] I have run a Tenderly simulation for this task\r\n- [ ] I have reviewed and understand all state changes in the simulation\r\n- [ ] I have verified that every state change reflects the **exact expected value** (e.g., if setting an `absolutePrestate`, confirm the precise `bytes32` hash matches expectations)\r\n- [ ] All state changes match the expected behavior documented in `VALIDATION.md`\r\n- [ ] I can explain every state diff to reviewers and signers\r\n\r\n### Task Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] `README.md` is complete with accurate task description\r\n- [ ] `VALIDATION.md` documents expected state changes with correct domain/message hashes\r\n- [ ] Task status is set appropriately\r\n- [ ] All TODOs in generated files have been addressed\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Additional context\r\n\r\n<!-- Any additional notes, risks, or considerations for reviewers -->\r\n",
